<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia flat as market waits for news.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia flat as market waits for news.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were unchanged Monday in very quiet holiday trade, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;The (ammonia) spot market continues to be very quiet,&quot; said an ammonia source. &quot;I expect it (the market) to stay where it is until we get news.&quot;</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton     Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-180			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	     225			  unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
